# Normalise line endings so the build works on every platform.
#
# The Maven wrapper is the one that really matters: mvnw is a shell script, and a CRLF shebang
# makes it fail on Linux/macOS with "bad interpreter". mvnw.cmd is the opposite case - it is a
# Windows batch file, which needs CRLF.
* text=auto
mvnw text eol=lf
mvnw.cmd text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
